  "scope": "Same 96 closest individual donors and same costs for both variants. Bandwidth is half the training median squared distance to the 12th different-order neighbour among 640 training query rows (floor .03); each selected neighbour is from a different order than its query, several can share an order with each other. Capacity is per donor passenger. Uniform donor capacity is penalized softly, with no class total imposed. Zero-support columns contribute a constant KL cost. Trimmed support approximates dense transport. Existing booking_transport_classifier_n26 compressed by class to prototypes and enforced strict capacity, broad_passenger_transport_n23 used strict balancing on a smaller nested roster."
}
